comments.body:
We can start from this and see whether the refresh token mechanism is supported in the future, so that the front end can refresh the token to obtain the latest role without the user providing a username and password. 

Another option is to consider not directly using the role claim in the token on the server side, but obtaining it through the database. (This has been discussed before and there is a decision to put role in token, will have to enquire from @louis4li )

@Supezm needs to put up a requirement for this.
